#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 放っておこう。捜査に集中だ。
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I need to forget about it for now and just concentrate\n"
"on the investigation."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここから出ても、
#. しばらくは監視カメラがトラウマになりそうだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Assuming I make it out of here alive, I'll never look\n"
"at surveillance cameras the same way again...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>うーん、ボクの好きな
#. “ダプクリアー”がないじゃないか！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hmm, that sucks. They don't have my personal favorite\n"
"Tab Clear here...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここ、購買部みたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Yup, this is definitely the school store.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もし、モノクマが店番してたら…
#. 想像するとシュールだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When I imagine Monokuma here, taking care of the\n"
"store... It's just surreal.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0007 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0008 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
